    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's what's so exhausting. the constant pressure to \"matter\" or \"contribute\" to a system that doesn't actually need me. it feels like i'm just Performing being a person. if the math stays the same whether i'm here or not, isn't there a certain kind of peace in just accepting that? in just letting go of the struggle to be visible?",
